    "turn_text": "I hear you, but we can also drive new markets for cleaner fuels. For example, this was something I tried to do in Congress over my nine terms. was to urge the Pentagon, which has the largest fleet of vehicles, and they're not all cars and buses, but fleet of everything, to move to flex fuels or cleaner fuels.",
